    rationale: "Vague conservatism doesn't transfer — specific criteria do. Defining reportable versus skippable categories with concrete boundaries gives the model an operable decision rule, which is what actually moves precision. Why not the others: A intensifies an instruction that has no operational content; B reorders noise instead of reducing it — self-stated confidence is poorly calibrated; C reviews less code with the same faulty judgment.",
