    prompt: "A synthesis agent receives findings from upstream agents and passes a consolidated prose summary to a report generation agent. During testing, the report generator makes factual claims but cannot accurately attribute them, because source metadata was lost during the summarization step. What is the most effective approach to ensure proper source attribution?",
